# Files NOT to send into the Docker build.
#
# When you run `docker build`, Docker copies the whole folder (the "build
# context") to the daemon. We exclude things that are huge, machine-specific,
# or that the build regenerates anyway. This keeps builds fast and avoids
# accidentally baking your local node_modules (built for macOS) into a Linux
# image — a classic "works on my machine" bug.

node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log
.env.local
.DS_Store
